      "value": "<p>At the start of the avatar's turn, they may relocate themselves and one other creature within 12 squares by up to 6 squares each. No save, no provoke. The room agreed to the change before anyone in it did.</p><p><em>It does not move. The space around it moves. The distinction does not matter to anyone except the people doing the moving.</em></p>",
